<title>USA: Muni bond sales total $608 mln for Tuesday Jan 28.</title>
<headline>Muni bond sales total $608 mln for Tuesday Jan 28.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive and negotiated municipal bond sales for Tuesday Jan 28 are expected to total $608 million in 25 offerings, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>Competitive sales total $223 million in 17 sales. The largest is a $50 million West Virginia Housing Development Fund issue at 1100 EST.</p>
<p>Negotiated sales total $385 million in eight offerings. The largest is a $128 million West Virginia School Building revenue bond issue through Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
